- **Knowledge and release limits:** “the Quieting” is not coined; no Compact policy, office, face, maker, source theory, still-place theory, or reason for Cael’s immunity is disclosed. The registry stamp and inside-written paper remain evidence, not explanation. Oryn knows nothing of fragments and reads nobody inside. Teague’s cutaway contains no forbidden mechanism knowledge and names none of his crew. No stillhound appears; only sign is found.
