Coordinator: Claude Opus 5.5. Reads consolidated (all on Sol): editorial, cold read, source-distance
read, plan / canon / protected-text audit. Same-author repair: the Opus 5.5 author seat.

Verdicts: the plan audit RATIFIES the movement with seven local line fixes (applied): structure,
calendar, the Quiet-line canon under the #49 default, the private tests, withheld truths and names
all hold. Source distance: four tracked passages, one dense scene (ch30 scene 2). Editorial: the
markers, Seln's case, a light cadence pass. Cold: the markers, ch28's repeated survey logic, two
anchors. No scene is moved.

