   Pike says it UNASKED, to the ledger. So: the ledger is now beside him on the hearth bench; Cael's
   spoken question is now a thought he had not yet found words for; and the paragraph after no
   longer repeats what Pike has just said. Re-read ch25:33–50 and make it read whole; nothing may
   repeat the protected content before or after it.
