## Must fix

### A. Seln's case (editorial 2)
At entry the locked case is shut on Seln's strap. In this movement it vanishes: the ch23 opening
inventory, the east-gate departure in ch27 and the gear sentence at ch30:7 leave it unaccounted for
(in the loft or on the mule). Add one unobtrusive strap-and-case beat on the Oxhollow road or at
