it over or explain it. (It goes over the line with him; nothing about it changes there.)

### B. Four tracked passages — break the chain (source distance)
You have not opened the source and must not. Same links in the same order still tracks.
1. **ch29:131** "He had watched her do that a thousand times…" Required: Lira's full burst becomes
   one step. Chain: Cael knows the preparation through an ordered list of body mechanics → she
