editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-38-- **The rim saw a practitioner walk out declaring, and saw nothing work inside.** Teague saw the same and asks nothing.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-39-- Faceless: no seals, no names, no office. The specialist is not the Ostrand-road woman: the same craft, a different weight in the laying.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-40-- The case is untouched. The index and the stroke-and-bar are not decoded. Nobody theorizes.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md:41:- Oryn joins as a stop on her route, never as "sixth," never "join." The Stair slip's three hundred is taken and never paid.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-42-- Teague's crew is unnamed, including in Teague's window. The healer of no Path does not appear until M8.
